        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Kaiser Permanente management recognizes the fact that transfer applicants may not possess all of the necessary or required job skills. Kaiser Permanente management, during the implementation stages, agrees to provide the necessary training to supplement some of the skills that transfer applicants would bring to the workplace. Necessary training will be at the Employer's expense.",
